– Open Locks: -5%
– Find Traps: -5%
– Pick Pockets: -20%
– Move Silently: -10%
- Hide in Shadows: -10%

Combat abilities:
- On hit the attacker takes -1 penalty to Luck for 1 round (non-cumulative)

Armor Class: 3 (1 vs. slashing, 2 vs. piercing and missile)
Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 6
"







