//ASLYFERUND ELVEN CHAIN +3 - 15000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/CHAN19.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Chain Mail"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "This chainmail clearly bears the hand of a great elvensmith, with their typical beauty and delicate sturdy craftsmanship.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 5 (3 vs. slashing, 4 vs. piercing and missile)
Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 8
"

	SAY NAME2 "Aslyferund Elven Chain +3"
	SAY DESC "Crafted in exile after the fall of Myth Drannor, this magnificent suit of elven chainmail is the tragic masterpiece of the elven smith Aslyferund. Driven by a desire to surpass his peers, he discovered a secret method to gild traditional mithral links with a rare, enchanted gold alloy, binding them with heavy layers of abjuration magic.The resulting armor offers unparalleled protection against elemental and magical forces while still allowing the casting of spells. Sadly, Aslyferund’s refusal to share his secret led to his brutal murder by a jealous rival. The secret died with him, leaving this armor as the only one of its kind in Faerûn.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Open Locks: -5%
– Find Traps: -5%
– Pick Pockets: -20%
– Move Silently: -10%
- Hide in Shadows: -10%
- All non physical damage resistances: +20%

Armor Class: 2 (0 vs. slashing, 1 vs. piercing and missile)
Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 5
"